+"""
+QA4-MOM closing-gap regression tests.
+
+Covers the verified MOM gaps:
+
+- Scraped site data shared between users (MOM نیمه‌کاره):
+  copy-on-write ownership for ``BrandWebsiteData`` /
+  ``BrandCoreAnalysis``. Two users whose brands share one
+  ``BrandIdentity`` must never mutate each other's rows: a force
+  refresh writes (or updates) a row OWNED by the asking brand, and
+  reads prefer brand-owned rows, falling back to the shared
+  (``brand=None``) identity-level row read-only.
+- Upload validation (MOM انجام‌نشده): brand asset uploads are
+  restricted to PNG/JPEG/WebP/SVG, max 5 MB.
